# BDS UI

- Follow `docs/DESIGN.md`. Hero = brand + one headline + one sentence + CTA + full-bleed image only.
- No hero overlays (badges, chips, stickers). No cards in the hero.
- Cards only for interactive listing items. Prefer editorial full-bleed sections.
- Typography via `next/font` + CSS variables; avoid Inter/Roboto/Arial/system-only.
- Earthy editorial palette via CSS variables — avoid purple-indigo AI gradients.
- Use Embla for carousels. Use Tailwind v4 (`@import "tailwindcss"`, `@theme`).
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion` for scroll/animation wrappers.
